ignment inside Canvas. • Students do NOT need a course ID to gain access. • If you are not sure which assignments are Achieve assignments, you may instead click Macmillan Learning in the left navigation panel of your Canvas course and click the Achieve link. (4) When prompted, enter your name and email address. • If you have an existing Achieve account that you would like to link to your Canvas account, enter the e-mail address of that Achieve account here. (5) Enter the access code purchased in your bookstore [CODE], then click the Enter button. • Do not register for your Achieve materials through the Achieve website. This will prevent your Achieve grades from appearing in the Canvas gradebook. • If you are not ready to make the purchase, when asked for the access code, you may instead click Start a grace period and get yourself 14 days of grace period. After 14 days, you will be required to pay for Achieve access. Technical Support If you experience any obstacles while using Achieve, you may contact customer support. If tech support is unable to resolve your issue, you may contact the following people: ## Page 2 Achieve Registration Process • Jordan Enzor jordan.enzor(cid:64)macmillan.com • Sierra Sherland sierra.sherland(cid:64)macmillan.com • Nathan Digweed nathan.digweed(cid:64)macmillan.com In the subject line, please provide the Case Number from your phone call/email with tech support."
